project/modelpool-bake-webp-source-normalize: gltf-transform io.read throws setTextureInfo->setMagFilter on null when a texture's image source is only under texture.extensions.EXT_texture_webp/avif/basisu.source (top-level texture.source undefined) — common in webp+draco game maps. streaming-gltf baker normalizeForRead() copies the ext source to top-level before read; sourceless textures fall back to image 0. Also guards empty primitives in vertcolor LOD. Fixed in streaming-gltf 1.0.4.